  "change": "The clearing, delivery and settlement-plan circuits already take units as a public input and the six-output transaction (four refunds, seller, fee) has the same shape at any unit count. Four checks pinned the funded path to three units: scripts/rehearsal.py standard_terms, scripts/settle_fresh_book.py TERMS, tools/nu7-compat funded_prepare and crates/native-gate integration terms. They now accept one to three units; budget 100, the 15,000 fee and reserve 0 or 20 stay pinned. No circuit, proof, verifying key, trusted-key check, admission rule or resource guard changed.",
